button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the standard <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-strongness condition in the same ambient class metatheory as the canonical strong-cardinal atom; both the two-place embedding signature and the class-sorted witnesses now match that source.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"1c58d8be3b47a5f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"1c58d8be3b47a5f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)$ is the ambient class-metatheoretic embedding predicate from [[58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal]]; its domain is fixed as $V$","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeStrongCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeStrongCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}strong\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeStrongCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\kappa<\\lambda\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\n\\lambda<j(\\kappa)\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2410","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-large-strong-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-large-strong-cardinal]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["1c58d8be3b47a5f9"]}